'''Super Hyppoh''' (デッカーバチャン, ''Dekkāba-chan'') is an [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]]/[[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]] variant of [[Hyppoh]] unique to the [[Horrorpotamus]] event. She was added in [[Version 9.8 Update|Version 9.8]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Super Hyppoh
|image = E 525.png
|appearance = [[Horrorpotamus]]
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
}}

==Enemy==
Super Hyppoh has low base stats unlike other [[Gauntlet|Colossus Gauntlet]] bosses released after her, but receives extreme buffs in many of her appearances. Her frequent attacks have a 100% chance to [[Slow]] anything she hits, which is compounded by her high movement speed, short backswing, and an [[Omni Strike]] that hits up to 350 range. Her one weakness is her high knockback count of 20 for her somewhat low health, though delivering enough brute force to impede her is easier said than done with the nasty support she comes with.

==Strategy==
:''See [[Horrorpotamus/Cosmic Juggernaut Lv.1~20]].''

