==Trivia==
*Super Hyppoh's Japanese description implies that she is the same character as [[Hyppoh]], which would make her the only known female [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]].
*Her Japanese name, Dekkāba-chan, is a portmanteau of でかい ''dekai'', meaning "big", and カーバチャン ''Kāba-chan'', Hyppoh's Japanese name.
*She is one of the six enemies that were updated to have the Colossus type in [[Version 11.2 Update|Version 11.2]], the others being [[Baron Seal]], [[Le'Grim]], [[Mega-Mooth]], [[Archangel Exiel]] and [[Big Peng Z]].
*Ironically, her base health and attack power are lower than Hyppoh's, though she never appears at 100% strength magnification.

